# Template file for 'nautilus-slim'
# Local test build only: this vendors a snapshot of the nautilus-slim fork
# (a dependency-slimmed Nautilus fork with no tracker/tinysparql, no glycin,
# no libportal/libgxdp, no gnome-desktop-4; see /home/gui/Projects/voidlab/
# nautilus-slim/DIVERGENCE.md for the full inventory) instead of an upstream
# tarball. distfiles below points nowhere real — the matching file is
# pre-placed in $XBPS_SRCDISTDIR/nautilus-slim-${version}/ so the fetch hook
# never dereferences the URL (see common/hooks/do-fetch/00-distfiles.sh:
# it only fetches when the target file is missing). Not meant for CI/publish.
